    <summary>Represents particular exercise within exercise session (see <c>ExerciseSessionRecord</c>).</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents particular exercise within exercise session (see <c>ExerciseSessionRecord</c>).</para>
      <para>Each record contains start and end time of the exercise, exercise type and optional number of
            repetitions.</para>
